{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bcf33a0b9b3538ca","name":"Toxin Detector","source":{"id":"source:reference-bcf33a0b9b3538ca","title":"Toxin Detector","revision":21272,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:28:27Z","sha256":"addf6aeda9bb4e0d2293f630501e1124d3e2c5fa1306418e6dbb9cc14ccac2f2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21272","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Toxin%20Detector&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bcf33a0b9b3538ca","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 700\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Assassination by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," is one of the dangers faced by nobles, politicians, and other notable figures. This tiny handheld device scans food and drink to determine if it is spoiled or contains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"},". Using the device requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". It has a range of one square and contains data for up to 100 different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". The Toxin Detector can be set to blink a light (green for safe food and red for dangerous) or to vibrate slightly when a toxin is detected. For an additional 100 credits, the Toxin Detector can be disguised as a bracelet or other piece of jewelry for maximum discretion.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
